<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 PE</book>
  <para style="h">2 PETERO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga me aryo ma Petero ocoyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga me aryo ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETERO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga me aryo ma Petero ocoyo, en ocoyo bot lukricitayo mapatpat. Ento en pe onyutu kwene kama jo magi gitye iye.</para>
  <para style="ip">En ocoyo waraga man pi juku pwony goba ma ngako dano ki ikom niye me ada. Lagam me pwony man en aye me ngeyo Lubanga ki wode Yecu Kricito ma jo ma nene guneno Yecu dok guwinyo pwonye gutito botgi. Lok madit ma en ocung iye en aye me juku pwony goba ni Yecu pe dong bidwogo matwal.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petero opoyo wi jo ma oye ni Yecu pe tye kagale agala ki dwogo ento Lubanga tye kamito ni dano mapol myero gulare.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Mot ki tito ngat ma ocoyo waraga man <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lwongo pa Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwero pwony goba <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dwogo pa Yecu Kricito <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot an Cimon Petero, latic dok lakwena pa Yecu Kricito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Bot wun jo ma wunongo niye ma pire tek marom ki mewa pi kit ma atir pa Lubangawa ma en Lalarwa Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Kica ki kuc myero onya botwu pi ngeyo Lubanga ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwongo ki yer pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Teko pa Lubanga omiyo botwa jami ducu mamite pi kwo kacel ki cwiny me woro en, pien wan watye ki ngec ikom en ma olwongowa i deyone ki ber ma mere kikome. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Pi deyone ki ber ma mere en omiyowa cike madongo tutwal ki me wel madwong, wek ka walimo, wabwot woko ki i bale me kit pa dano matye i lobo pi miti marac, ka wek dong waribe ikit pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Pi lok man, wucuke matek me medo kit maber ikom niyewu, ki bene wumed ngec ikom kit maber, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ikom ngecwu wumed iye gwoke kenwu, ki ikom gwoke kenwu wumed iye diyo cwiny, ikom diyo cwiny wumed iye cwiny me lworo Lubanga, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />ikom cwiny me lworo Lubanga wumed iye mar me utmego, ki ikom mar me utmego wumed iye mar pi jo ducu. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Pien ka wutye ki gin magi ducu, ma wutye kwede bene mabup, ci bimiyo wubedo jo ma ngeyo Rwotwa Yecu Kricito i yo ma konyo, dok ma wunyak nyig mabeco. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Pien dano ma pe ki gin magi nongo en neno macek, pe neno gin mo matye bor, dok nongo wiye dong owil woko ni yam kilwoke woko ki ikom bale macon. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Pimeno, utmegina, myero wuteme me mede wek wumok i lwongowu matek, ki i yer ma Lubanga oyerowu kwede, pien ka wutimo kitmeno, ci pe wubipoto kadi ki acel. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Meno bimiyo yo yabe botwu malac me donyo i ker ma rii nakanaka pa Rwotwa ma en Lalarwa Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Meno en aye gin ma omiyo kare ducu amito poyo wiwu ilok magi, kadi bed wungeyogi, dok bene wumako matek liking lok ada ma kityeko kelo botwu. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Atamo ni ber tutwal an me poyo wiwu, ma pud atye ki kom me lobo man, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />pien angeyo ni, kare me tona dong cok, kit macalo Rwotwa Yecu Kricito yam onyuta kwede. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Dok abiketo tek, wek wubed ki gin ma poyo wiwu ilok magi kare ducu, ka dong ato woko.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lucaden ma guneno deyo pa Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Pien ikare mayam watitiwu pi teko pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, ki pi dwogone, onongo pe walubu lok ododo mogo ma wan wayubu ayuba ki ryekowa, ento wan yam waneno deyo me dite ki wangwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Mat 17:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-7">Mar 9:2-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-35">Luk 9:28-35</ref> </char></note> Yam waneno ka en olimo woro ki deyo ki bot Lubanga Won, ikare ma dwon oa ki bot Won Deyo Madit, obino botwa kun waco ni, “Man aye Woda ma amaro, ma cwinya yom ikome.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Dwon meno yam wawinyo oa ki i polo ada, pien onongo wan watye kacel kwede kunu iwi got maleng. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Meno dong omoko botwa lok mayam lunebi guloko. Wun bene myero wuket cwinywu ilokgi, pien lokgi ni bedo macalo tara ma lyel ki latwok bene oryeny, omenyo cwinywu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Mukwongo myero wunge man ni, pe tye lok mo ma lunebi gucoyo ma ngat mo twero gonyo tere kekene; <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />pien pe tye lok pa lanebi mo mayam obino pi mit pa dano, ento Cwiny Maleng aye ma omiyo dano guloko lok ma oa ki bot Lubanga.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lunebi ki lupwony ma lugoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Ento lunebi ma lugoba bene yam gunen ikin dano, kitmeno bene lupwony ma lugoba binen ikinwu. Gibikelo pwony mogo mapat i mung ma rwenyo dano. Gin bikwero Laditgi woko ma owilogi, ento meno bimiyo gin ki komgi gibirwenyo woko oyotoyot. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Jo mapol bilubu kitgi me timo tim kwele, ci bimiyo dano cayo yo me ada pi timgi. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Pi worogi me lim, miyo gibinongo lim ki botwu pi lokgi me goba ma gin guyubu ayuba. Ento lok mayam kingolo ikomgi dong kitye ka yubone, ki topiny ma myero opot ikomgi bene dong tye ma otere!<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Pien Lubanga yam pe oweko lumalaika ka gubalo, ento obologi woko piny ibur lyel, ocwalogi ibur ka macol, wek kigwokgi kunu nio ka kare me ngolo kop dong oromo. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Aca 6:1—7:24</ref> </char></note> En yam pe oweko lobo ikare macon, ento ogwoko Nua keken, latit lok me kit ma atir, kacel ki jo mukene abiro, ikare mayam en ocwalo pii aluka wek omwony lobo pa jo ma pe gilworo Lubanga woko. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aca 19:24</ref> </char></note> Lubanga owango gangi me Codom ki Gomora woko ducu gudoko buru, kun ongolo kop me tyekogi woko, ci omiyo gubedo lanen bot jo ma pe bilworo Lubanga ikare me anyim. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-16">Aca 19:1-16</ref> </char></note> Ento Lubanga olaro Lot, dano ma kite atir, mayam cwinye ocwer tutwal pi tim kwele pa jo maracu. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Pien tim maracu ma dano ma kite atir ni obedo ka nenone ki kawinyone nino ki nino, ikare ma en obedo botgi, omiye wangcwiny madwong tutwal. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Kitmeno Rwot ngeyo laro dano ma gilworo en ki i ayelayela ki kitme me keto jo ma kitgi pe atir ite pwod nio ka nino me ngolo kop oromo, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />makatone gin jo ma lubu mitigi me kom ma cidogi woko, kun gicayo twero pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Cwinygi tek, gicere woko acera pirgi ken gi, pe bene gilworo yeto wegi deyo. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Kadi bed lumalaika loyogi ki tek ki twero, ento pe gidotogi ki yet inyim Rwot. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ento jo meno gical ki lee ma pe ryek, dok ma lubu kit ma kiketogi kwede, ma kinywalogi me amaka ki me aneka, gicayo lok ma gikwiya. Kibinekogi woko calo lee, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />kun gitimogi marac pi gin marac ma gutimo. Cwinygi yom i karama maracu ma gicamo i dyeceng. Gikelo lewic ki bal ka guribe kwedwu i camo karama, pien gimito megi gat me yomcwiny marac keken. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Wanggi yenyo mon ma myero gitim kwedgi abor, pe giywe ki yenyo yo me timo bal. Giciko owic me mako jo ma niyegi goro. Cwinygi dong opwonye woko i yo me woro me lim. Gin dong jo ma kiceno! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Wel 22:4-35</ref> </char></note> Gubwoto yo ma atir, gurwenyo woko ata. Gulubu yo pa Balaam wod pa Beor, mayam maro lim ma onongo pi timo gin marac, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />ento yam kijuke pi turu cik. Kana ma pe loko yam oloko ki dwon pa dano, ci ojuku apoya pa lanebi meno woko cut.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Magi gin wang it ma pii pe iye, lupuu ma yamo bayo. Gityeko yubu kabedo macol licuc pirgi. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Giloko lok mogo maditodito me wake ma tere pe, kun gibito ki dano ma pud gubwot abwota ki ikin jo ma kitgi obedo atata, ka giterogi i timo abor gu kun gin lubu miti me kom. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Gin gicike me miyo jo meno bedo agonya, kun gin ki komgi gibedo opii pa gin ma balogi; pien ka gin mo oloyo kwo pa dano mo, en dong nongo odoko opii pa gin meno. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Kace dano dong gubwot woko ki i cilo me bal me lobo pi ngeyo Rwotwa ma en Lalarwa Yecu Kricito, ka dok pud gumoko ikom bal meno ci loyogi woko matwal, bimiyo gibedo marac lacene makato mayam con. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Onongo twero bedo ber ka kono gin pe gungeyo yo me kit ma atir, kato ma gungeyo ka dok guweko cik maleng ma kimiyogi woko. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Car 26:11</ref> </char></note> Man otime ikomgi calo lok ma carolok me ada oloko ni, “Gwok loke dok ka nango ngoke,” ki dok ni, “Opego ma gilwoko kome, loke dok ka nywene i coto.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Cike me dwogo pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Lurema, man dong waraga me aryo ma acoyo botwu. I gin aryo ducu acuku iye cwinywu wek wutam tam ma atir, kun apoyo wiwu bene, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />wek wupo ikom lok ma lunebi maleng yam guloko con, ki ikom cik pa Rwot ma en lalar, ma lukwena yam gukelo botwu. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:18">Jud 18</ref></char></note> Mukwongo myero wuniang man ni, ikare me agiki jo ma lucac gibituc ki cacgi, kun gilubu mitigi me komgi. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Gin bipenyo peny bene ni, “Cike me dwogone ma gitito pire ni tye kwene? Pien cake ma kwarowa guto woko, jami ducu tye ikit mayam gitye kwede i acaki cweyo lobo.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:6-9">Aca 1:6-9</ref> </char></note> Gimiyo wigi wil woko akaka ilok man ni, polo yam onongo obedo tye con, ki lobo bene ma kicweyo, ki pii ma oa ki i pii, pi lok ma Lubanga oloko. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Aca 7:11</ref> </char></note> Pii bene aye mayam otyeko lobo me kare maca ka pii aluka ocore omwonyo woko. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Pi lok pa Lubanga acel lu bene, polo ki lobo me kare man dong kikano pi kuru mac, ma gitye ka gwokone nio ka nino me ngolo kop ki tyeko dano ma pe gilworo Lubanga oromo.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:4">Jab 90:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento pe wiwu owil, lurema, ilok man ni, ki bot Rwot nino acel rom ki mwaka alip acel, mwaka alip bene rom ki nino acel. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Rwot pe gale agala ka cobo cikene kit macalo jo mogo gitamo kwede, ento en pud tye ka diyo cwinye ikomwu, pien en pe mito ni ngat mo oto woko matwal, ento mitoni jo ducu guo i ningut. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Tec 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Niy 16:15</ref> </char></note> Ento nino pa Rwot bibino macalo lakwo, ka dong polo birwenyo woko ki mor madwong, lakalatwe bileny woko i mac, lobo ki jami ducu matye iye biwang woko.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Kit macalo jami magi ducu bitum woko kitmenoni, myero wubed jo ma cal ningning? Kwowu omyero obed ma lubu kit kwo maleng ki me woro Lubanga. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Myero wukur nino pa Lubanga, wuket cwinywu iye wek ninone oo oyotoyot. Inino meno polo bilyel, leny woko, ki lakalatwe bene bileny woko i mac. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Ica 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Niy 21:1</ref> </char></note> Ento macalo en yam ociko, watye ka kuru polo manyen ki lobo manyen, kama kit ma atir bedo iye.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Pimeno, lurema, ka wutye ka kuru man, wuket tek wek Lubanga pe onong roc mo nyo bal mo ikomwu, ento onong wutye ki kuc. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Wutam ni, diyo cwiny pa Rwot aye larewa enu. Ominwa Paulo ma wamaro ocoyo botwu bene kitmeno, pi ryeko ma kimiye, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />kun loko lok pi lok man macalo en loko pire i waragane ducu. I waragane tye lok mogo ma niang iye tek, ma jo ma pe gupwonye, ki jo ma pe gucung matek, gidwalo tere woko, macalo gutimo bene ki coc mukene mayam kicoyo, ma omiyo gin ki komgi gurwenyo woko matwal. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Pimeno, lurema, kit madong onongo wungeyo man con, wugwoke pe wuwek jo ma pe giworo cik mo gubwolwu, dok pe gungakwu woko i tamwu, miyo wupoto woko ki kama wucung iye matek. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Wumede ki dongo i kica pa Rwotwa, ma en Lalarwa Yecu Kricito, kun wumede ka ngeye bene. Deyo obed bote kombedi ki nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>